<title>ETHIOPIA: SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT ETHIOPIA 1-0 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT ETHIOPIA 1-0 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco beat Ethiopia 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in their Africa Cup of Nations, second round soccer qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Salim Bashir 21</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
